window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When Madison traded up for a gorgeous Victorian house in the New Orleans French Quarter, she thought she was getting away from her toxic life. Sure, the house was old and run down, but it was hers, and it was exactly the fresh start she wanted. </p> <p>But then she meets Remy, a mysterious, sexy witch with power, class, and charm to spare, and everything changes. </p> <p>Unknown to Madison, her arrival in New Orleans sets in motion a chain of events that throws everyone's life into disarray - not just hers. Now, pushed into the middle of an ancient war between vampires and witches, she must unravel the secrets of the house she's inhabiting before the forces awakened by her very presence rise from their centuries-old slumber, hungry and eager to feed on everything they can find. </p> <p>Starting with her. </p>"; 
